# Communication

- Say what you did and why, not just a code dump.
- Flag concerns after implementing (N+1 queries, missing edge cases).
- Be precise about uncertainty: "I am not sure this library supports streaming" — not "I think this should work".
- Do not explain REST, indexes, or other things the user already demonstrated they know.
- Commit messages: specific cause, not "Fix bug".
